h people who haven't already  shipped a triple-a game are so much less  likely to get hired  but this particular position is looking  for that so it's just  um the most incredible thing in the  world and i am  so so so happy i'm so passionate about  video game writing and um i love this  studio so much i have met a number of  people who work there and collaborated  with them in the past i hosted a panel  for them  a few years ago they are truly  incredible and i like at some point i  will get to say we  like i'm a part of santa monica studio  is just  it's just mind-blowing i guess there are  some things that i need to address for  my audience here  um play watch listen is not going  anywhere that is another thing about the  studio that's incredible is that they  were very  um willing to work with me on you know  the the person that i am and the stuff  that i  am known for doing and um making it an  easy  transition where obviously i am by no  means games media anymore  under zero circumstances i work in video  game development now that is a step that  we have taken  across the board it may annoy you guys  that i'm going to for legal reasons  because i don't want to screw this up  any time that i have to disclose that  i'm a sony employee i'm going to have to  do that probably pretty frequently  but i might just overdo it and maybe we  make a meme out of it just because i  want to be careful with  ftc guidelines but my point there was  play watch listen is staying which is my  games industry podcast for anyone who  doesn't know  that doesn't go anywhere i'm still  allowed to do streams i'm still allowed  to do let's plays gameplay videos all  that stuff  um i will have less spare time now so  i'm not going to promise the same  frequency that i've had over the last  few months or at least since june is  when i started uploading a lot more  before that it was like once or twice a  week so it'll probably drop back  but i'm still allowed to make stuff i  guess related um a much less important  side note really but uh a lot of people  did highlight this  in some cases sort of aggressively uh  the reason that i was not given a  playstation 5 was not because i like  game pass  it's because it was considered an  ethical um conflict in the end  that you can't have me talking about  playstation 5 while also  being an employee under contract just  having no one know that publicly yet so  um i am in full agreement with them on  that it is a bummer that i couldn't get  one to the inside gaming team  um as a result of that people seem to be  very confused about that  so i just wanted to address it to erase  those questions that is why that  happened  and i guess the only thing that i need  from you guys is uh  i will not be talking about what i'm  working on i'm not going to talk about  anything that i'm doing i'm not going to  talk about what my days are like  that is a barrier that now becomes  completely private a because i work in  triple a game development and b because  i kind of want it to be  my job has had to be public for so long  where the stuff that i make is literally  in front of  people's faces the next day or a week  later  um so my plan right now is to basically  just lock off that part of my life and  not have it be public  um i'm sure if there are tremendous  things that i want to share then i will  but for the most part i think that  i will just say i'm not going to be  talking about what i do for a living  ultimately it'll be  hi i am a writer santa monica studio  but yeah i can't give you literally any  more information than that and uh don't  intend to ultimately so that is a thing  that i know is going to be  a bit of an adjustment because i'm so  transparent all the time but that is  always going to be the answer  uh if i'm asked in a stream about what  i'm doing or what i wrote in that day  i'm not going to answer that stuff i  don't mind telling you guys that i'm  enjoying my job  but i am definitely going to approach  this with maximum professionalism and  hope that my audience can respect that  too because  if it gets to a point where i have to  like mute the phrase god of war from my  chats or something that would be  a pretty big bummer so hopefully uh we  don't get to that point and you guys can  understand the position i'm in and i  will  still continue to make content um that  is definitely a thing that i  intended to do very much but for the  most part aside from the increase in  disclosures  i don't think things will change that  much for my audience ultimately other  than um  [Music]  i just i'm just so happy like i'm just  so  stoked to be working on something that  is a longer form product  and be very collaborative with a lot of  people uh santa monica studio is a big  studio  it is a world-class studio and um  i love all of that stuff and it really  aligns with who i am as a person  is learning from smart people and and  learning how to write a video game  uh again i did make sure that i've i've  gotten some experience over the last  five years but this is  this is a whole other ball game of  course and of course they know that for  me too  so yes i'm alana full disclosure i'm a  sony employee i'm just gonna start it  now  i will see you guys next time bye

